  "title": {
   "en": "Uchi Ni Kaette Kon Katsu Shimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ウチに帰って婚活します"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A matchmaking share house produced by a women's fashion magazine. Eight men and women, without revealing their age or occupation, live together for three months to find a marriage partner. People have different reasons for gathering in the share house: they're too busy with work to keep up with finding a partner, they want to find a partner quickly, they admire their parents' lovey-dovey ways...\n\n\"You can live alone, but don't you sometimes wish you had someone by your side?\"\n\n(Source: Shogakukan, translated)",
   "ja": "恋するシェアハウスがオープン！ここでは８人の男女が年齢と職業を明かさずに、３ヶ月間の共同生活を送りパートナーを見つける。ファッション誌「CanCam」×漫画誌「Cheese!」がスペシャルコラボ、等身大の恋愛オムニバスシリーズ!!"
  },
